tvdinner (0.1.0-105) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix the XMLTV parser dropping all but the first <category> tag on a
    programme -- XMLTV allows several (a genre plus "Movie", commonly),
    but elem.find("category") only ever kept the first. For feeds that
    list the specific genre before "Movie" (confirmed live against
    epg.best's TCM feed: "Crime drama" then "Movie"), this silently broke
    --tmdb-api-token's only signal for detecting a movie programme --
    ratings never fetched, no matter how correct the token was. Now joins
    every <category> tag instead of keeping just the first. Also adds
    README/website documentation for --tmdb-api-token, which shipped
    undocumented in 0.1.0-102

