tvdinner (0.1.0-29) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Stream-parse XMLTV (ElementTree.iterparse) instead of building a
    full DOM (ElementTree.fromstring) to cut EPG load memory use: a
    real ~500MB US EPG feed previously peaked at ~5GB RSS and settled
    at ~4.3GB after parsing; now peaks at ~1.2GB and settles at
    ~0.75GB, with identical parsed output and no change in parse time

